1140 0 obj
  << /ActualText (NLD India Software Pvt\056 Ltd\056                                                                                                                                 Web designer  \174 Apr 2025 \023 Present\n Designed\054 developed\054 and delivered 5\053 enterprise SaaS applications from Figma design to production deployment\056\n Designed 100\053 responsive UI screens and developed 60\053 reusable Angular components\054 improving UI consistency and reducing development effort across projects\056\n Integrated 30\053 REST API endpoints for logistics\054 document automation\054 employee management\054 and reporting modules\056\n Redesigned existing applications by improving layouts\054 resulting in a more intuitive and consistent user experience\056\n Built responsive interfaces supporting desktop\054 tablet\054 and mobile devices while ensuring cross\055browser compatibility\056\n Participated in requirement analysis\054 UI planning\054 design discussions\054 and frontend architecture decisions throughout the development lifecycle\056\nKey Projects\nWellink \050Angular\051                                                                                                                      Enterprise Logistics \046 Order Management Platform\n Designed the complete user experience and converted Figma designs into a fully functional Angular application\056\n Developed 30\053 screens covering order management\054 customer workflows\054 shipment processing\054 and Bill of Lading generation\056\n Integrated multiple REST APIs for real\055time order and shipment processing\056\nValidation Portal \050Angular\051                                                                                                                            AI\055Based Document Validation System\n Designed and developed the frontend for AI\055powered document validation and extracted data review\056\n Implemented 20\053 responsive interfaces for reviewing and validating extracted document information\056\n Improved workflow efficiency through clean layouts\054 dynamic tables\054 and intuitive navigation\056\nClearPort \050Angular\051                                                                                                            Shipment Tracking \046 Document Management Platform\n Designed and implemented shipment tracking dashboards and document management modules\056\n Developed interfaces for 10\053 shipping document types\054 including Bill of Lading\054 Invoice\054 Packing List\054 Delivery Order\054 and Cargo details\056\n Enhanced document accessibility through structured information architecture and responsive UI\056\nClockChamp \050Angular\051                                                                                                                 Employee Attendance \046 HR Management System\n Leading the UI\057UX design and frontend implementation of the employee attendance platform currently under development\056\n Designed 40\053 modern application screens covering attendance\054 employee profiles\054 leave management\054 teams\054 managers\054 reports\054 and settings\056    \n Working with backend APIs to implement scalable employee and attendance management workflows\056\nNLD India Corporate Website \050React\056js\051\n Independently designed the complete website in Figma and developed it using React\056js\056\n Improved the company\047s online presence with a professional and responsive corporate website\056\n\nFotografix Enterprises Pvt\056 Ltd\056 \050Contractual\051                                                                                                        Graphic Artist \174 Jun \055 Oct \0502023\051\n Performed professional image retouching\054 color correction\054 background removal\054 and photo enhancement using Adobe Photoshop\056\n Delivered 100\053 design assets while maintaining visual consistency and meeting project deadlines\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
